{"id": "34369", "title": "年少不怕轻狂", "author": "贝佳", "category": "文学名著", "count": 47, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34369.htm", "intro": "啊——她真的“老”了吗?怎地一封突然来自异国的e－mail竟勾起她一阵阵的回忆咧? 那段年少轻狂的往事呀——怪了，当初她是怎么和他恋起来的? 那个来自巴拿马的留学生……简直是个又任性、又霸道，又爱闹情绪的傢伙! 事隔多年，他竟一点长进也没，今儿个，她远从台湾来到他国家，好歹他也该给个好脸色嘛!瞧瞧他那脸色……活像被抛弃了似!可，分明提分手的是他呀——啊?难不成是她答应得太爽快了? 还是她不像其他女人一样对他的离去哭闹以对? 对上这么个不可爱的傢伙，她该怎么回报才好咧?", "base": "files/article/html/34/34369", "chapters": [{"title": "第1页", "file": "2183492.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2183493.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2183494.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2183495.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2183496.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2183497.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2183498.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2183499.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2183500.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2183501.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2183502.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2183503.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2183504.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2183505.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2183506.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2183507.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2183508.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2183509.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2183510.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2183511.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2183512.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2183513.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2183514.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2183515.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第25页", "fi